# Data policy (CLAUDE.md): verbatim third-party content is never committed.
#
# _ringsdb_*.json  raw RingsDB API responses - third-party card database
# state.json       live game state; embeds full card records incl. printed text
# log.jsonl        append-only ledger; its state snapshots embed the same
#
# What IS committed is our own writing: engine.py, README.md, and log.md - the
# rendered narrative, which names cards and quotes a line where a rules point
# turns on it, exactly as quests/*.md and CLAUDE.md already do.
_ringsdb_*.json
state.json
log.jsonl
